# Next.js 16 auto-generates per-app agent rule files (every *-web app: the
# scaffold and every business app cloned from it). Never hand-author these —
# authored business-app docs live in apps/<name>-api/AGENTS.md instead, see
# .ai/rules/business-app.md.
apps/*-web/AGENTS.md
apps/*-web/CLAUDE.md

